{"ID":"20240118151140-d9ztbx8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151140-d9ztbx8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151140-d9ztbx8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151140-ozqn54v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125626-99p77wz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122125626-99p77wz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:297,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:297\u0026#125;","title":"179紫苑","type":"doc","updated":"20240201093413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151140-ozqn54v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151140-ozqn54v","updated":"20240122125608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，温，无毒。治咳逆上气，胸中寒热结气，去蛊毒，痿厥，安五脏．一名青菀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125613-8msq65d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125613-8msq65d"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】为山野多年生草本，产我国中部，庭园亦可栽植，其花美丽，根状似细辛，其质柔轫，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125615-e1dyujn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125615-e1dyujn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦辛，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125616-zj148od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125616-zj148od"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】紫苑为祛痰止咳要药，主治咳逆，痰涎，吐脓血，益肺气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125618-vi4c6j1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125618-vi4c6j1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗咳唾脓血，止喘悸，五劳体虚，补不足，小儿惊痫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125620-g0by31p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125620-g0by31p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治尸疰，补虚下气，劳气虚热，百邪鬼魅。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125621-5wcfpbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125621-5wcfpbw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】调中消痰，止渴润肌肤，添骨髓。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125623-c9m0fgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125623-c9m0fgr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【好古】益肺气，主息贲。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125624-svrwcvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125624-svrwcvv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通七分至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125625-ww6qjgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125625-ww6qjgl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】肺病咳逆喘嗽，皆阴虚肺热也，忌独用多用，即用亦须与二冬百部桑皮等苦寒药参用，方无害以其性温也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122125610-vxzpltk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125610-vxzpltk"}},{"ID":"20240122125626-xbhhwv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125626-xbhhwv1"}},{"ID":"20240122125626-fe3iesj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125626-fe3iesj"}},{"ID":"20240122125626-99p77wz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122125626-99p77wz","updated":"20240201093413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一七九味药，叫做紫苑，我们这个药，祛痰。我们治疗咳嗽的时候用得非常多，张仲景呢，也用得很多，那它的主要的性味呢，味苦辛，又有辛辣的味道，又苦，能够泻，辛是散苦是泻，所以呢我们如果说肺里面有水，它是一定可以的，因为它是辛辣的，可以散，那苦又可以泻下，肺里面有积水。痰，也可以，当然可以祛痰啦，所以很多的咳嗽，里面除了，本身我们要治疗咳嗽的话，要把痰去掉，或者要把痰要把水也去掉，那紫苑是很好使用的一个药。那最主要是用在这个祛痰止咳，病人呢，如果有肺家病比较严重的时候，咳出脓血来，或者是肺气不足，呼吸很短都可以考虑使用紫苑。由于紫苑的性是温的，所以寒家的咳嗽，寒咳，我们可以加上紫苑。那肺癌，肺结核，名称不管，病名不管，要出现肺寒证的人，咳血，咳嗽，都可以使用紫苑。那剂量呢，诸位看看紫苑长这个样子，它很轻，你可以用一钱哪两钱，严重的三钱都没有关系。"}]}]}